WEBVTT

00:43.830 --> 00:45.790
Will you be all right?

00:52.840 --> 00:55.380
Why did you come to rescue me?

00:55.470 --> 00:58.850
Because I'm to blame. Just relax now.

00:59.600 --> 01:03.640
You built the Fuegos and
the terrorists' RideBacks, didn't you?

01:03.730 --> 01:04.810
No.

01:06.350 --> 01:12.020
I don't know what lies he told you,
but he isn't even a real terrorist.

01:12.110 --> 01:15.570
But I do think he told me the truth.

01:18.530 --> 01:22.580
Ogata. The Fuegos are nothing
but a lingering attachment I have.

01:22.660 --> 01:25.120
I dragged you into this.

01:26.290 --> 01:27.500
I'm sorry.

03:30.040 --> 03:34.630
<i>Romanov Cullenberg. Get ready. I'm coming for you.</i>

03:36.500 --> 03:38.380
Call a meeting!

03:38.460 --> 03:42.680
Won't declaring a state of emergency
cause a public backlash?

03:42.760 --> 03:45.390
Do you have a problem with my decisions?

03:45.470 --> 03:49.720
We're protecting them from terrorists.
I don't give a damn how they feel.

03:58.980 --> 04:02.530
We will place checkpoints on
all major highways within 24 hours.

04:02.610 --> 04:05.660
The independent anti-terrorist
teams will take Level 4 measures.

04:06.740 --> 04:09.580
Detain anyone who resists.

04:09.660 --> 04:13.460
We will stamp out every
last terrorist within one month!

04:19.840 --> 04:21.820
Hishida

04:31.980 --> 04:35.850
We interrupt this program to bring you breaking news.

04:35.940 --> 04:38.190
The GGP has declared a state of emergency

04:38.270 --> 04:40.480
in order to cope with the string of terrorist attacks.

04:40.570 --> 04:43.400
A nighttime curfew has been issued for all civilians,

04:43.490 --> 04:46.200
and it appears the police have received direct orders

04:46.280 --> 04:49.030
to seize all unapproved
vehicles, particularly RideBacks.

04:49.120 --> 04:53.040
Moreover, all RideBack import
agents in the city are being asked

04:53.120 --> 04:56.500
to temporarily halt all sales
and provide lists of all past purchasers.

04:56.580 --> 04:59.540
According to an SNN independent investigation,

04:59.630 --> 05:02.210
it appears that security checkpoints
have already been established

05:02.300 --> 05:05.220
in multiple locations in the city
and that traffic is being regulated.

05:05.300 --> 05:09.180
As the Japanese government was given no prior notice

05:09.260 --> 05:11.560
and prescribed procedures were not followed,

05:11.640 --> 05:16.730
Foreign Minister Ogino expressed
his firm opposition to the GGP's actions.

05:17.810 --> 05:20.650
Protests against the GGP's
state of emergency declaration

05:20.730 --> 05:23.150
have broken out throughout the area.

05:23.240 --> 05:27.530
The situation is very tense,
with clashes with police groups

05:27.620 --> 05:29.950
resulting in multiple arrests.

05:28.660 --> 05:34.640
Get out of our country!

05:30.030 --> 05:34.080
However, with the ruling party
split regarding the legal interpretation

05:34.160 --> 05:36.080
of the GGP's state of emergency declaration,

05:36.160 --> 05:40.380
all eyes will be on the government
to see if it can take a firm stance.

05:49.680 --> 05:53.720
Sounds like the GGP's regulations
have the outside in a real uproar.

05:53.810 --> 05:55.180
Where is she?

05:55.270 --> 05:56.520
Resting upstairs.

05:57.850 --> 06:00.270
--Let me see your arm.
--I'll be fine.

06:01.770 --> 06:04.570
I can't have you dripping blood on the--

06:07.110 --> 06:08.360
That's terrible...

06:36.220 --> 06:39.230
<i>The flames of the burning forest after the bombing...</i>

06:39.310 --> 06:43.400
<i>The unreal, old-stage-backdrop-look to everything...</i>

06:45.610 --> 06:50.360
<i>The flickering light that seemed to</i>
<i>be filled with life rather than heat...</i>

06:52.530 --> 06:54.530
<i>I found myself dazzled by it.</i>

06:55.950 --> 07:01.420
<i>What a beautiful sight...</i>
<i>The resonance of light and flame...</i>

07:12.470 --> 07:14.010
<i>The Fuego...</i>

07:31.700 --> 07:33.490
<i>My lingering attachment...</i>

07:53.680 --> 07:55.390
Where are you going?!

07:56.390 --> 07:58.260
We can't stay here for long either.

07:58.350 --> 08:02.270
It's all right!
A shrewd politician uses this as a hideout!

08:02.350 --> 08:06.770
Not even the top prosecutors
know about it, and it isn't on any maps...

08:07.610 --> 08:10.230
Be ready to run at any time.

08:10.940 --> 08:15.240
Why'd you call me out here?
Where are you going to disappear to?

08:15.320 --> 08:17.990
Look after Ogata for a couple days.

08:18.080 --> 08:20.120
I'm going to create a chance for her to escape.

08:20.200 --> 08:25.120
There's no way you can now.

08:25.210 --> 08:28.000
They have security checkpoints everywhere...

08:32.170 --> 08:35.010
Tamayo. I'm sorry.

08:51.940 --> 08:54.610
Don't make us worry about you...

08:59.510 --> 09:00.290
Get out of our country!

09:00.290 --> 09:00.760
Say no to the GGP's clampdown!

09:00.290 --> 09:00.760
Rise in Revolt Rally

09:00.770 --> 09:01.930
Say no to the GGP's clampdown!

09:00.770 --> 09:02.810
Rise in Revolt Rally

09:04.920 --> 09:07.880
We can't just take this sitting down...!

09:10.960 --> 09:12.710
Tamayo?!

09:33.530 --> 09:35.240
Hishida?

09:36.150 --> 09:44.040
"Rin is safe. She's apparently
with Tamayo! What a relief!

09:44.120 --> 09:47.210
I'll let you know if I find out anything else."

09:48.960 --> 09:51.540
Rin, you're all right!

09:53.170 --> 09:54.880
Thank goodness...!

10:02.010 --> 10:03.060
Got one!

10:09.230 --> 10:11.860
Should we really be doing this?

10:14.360 --> 10:16.650
It's vital that we secure food.

10:18.240 --> 10:22.410
I put our corporate lawyer
in charge of your brother's case.

10:22.490 --> 10:26.540
Thank you! I'm... not sure what to say...

10:26.620 --> 10:29.580
Don't look so flustered.

10:29.670 --> 10:32.630
Oh, yeah. Our club stayed here last year.

10:32.710 --> 10:35.550
We all had a great time fishing!

10:35.630 --> 10:40.010
Kawai was dressed like a fishing expert
but didn't catch a single thing!

10:40.890 --> 10:42.340
Okay, we've got dinner!

10:43.180 --> 10:49.100
How did you start riding an RBZ?

10:49.190 --> 10:51.650
My old man's a real pervert,

10:51.730 --> 10:56.230
so he was hardly ever home
because of all the new girls he was seeing.

10:56.320 --> 11:00.450
I guess I felt irritated in that environment,

11:00.530 --> 11:03.450
so when he said he'd buy
anything I want for my birthday

11:03.530 --> 11:07.120
I purposely asked him for
an impossible-to-get RBZ.

11:08.080 --> 11:10.080
But he somehow got one, so...

11:10.170 --> 11:11.750
Maddening, huh?

11:11.830 --> 11:13.880
He sounds like a nice father.

11:13.960 --> 11:16.170
Not at all.

11:16.250 --> 11:20.260
I wound up with the RBZ out of impure motives,

11:20.340 --> 11:23.720
but now I can't live without it.

11:23.800 --> 11:25.760
It's almost like my double, I suppose.

11:28.520 --> 11:33.980
I finally understand. It was just a lie.

11:35.480 --> 11:38.820
At first it felt like the Fuego's limbs were my own,

11:38.900 --> 11:40.490
being able to jump freely...

11:40.570 --> 11:45.780
So I started to grow closer to
the Fuego, almost like it was a friend.

11:45.870 --> 11:49.660
But I realize now that I was only using it

11:49.750 --> 11:53.710
as a replacement for my injured legs,

11:53.790 --> 11:58.750
that my feelings for
the Fuego were a lie of my own creation.

12:00.090 --> 12:04.550
Which is why I've decided to stop riding RideBacks.

12:04.640 --> 12:06.930
What will you do instead?

12:07.010 --> 12:08.890
Take up ballet again?

12:09.810 --> 12:11.270
I don't know...

12:13.440 --> 12:16.270
It's your choice to stop riding, but as club president

12:16.360 --> 12:20.570
I can't allow you to quit
before our match has been settled.

12:20.650 --> 12:24.450
You can only quit if you beat me!

12:24.530 --> 12:27.320
On second thought, I guess we don't need losers.

12:27.410 --> 12:28.990
Sorry.

12:39.800 --> 12:41.840
<i>Please let Kenji be all right...</i>

12:44.130 --> 12:46.760
<i>I guess I can't give it to her now...</i>

12:52.480 --> 12:55.440
Yes, it's been a real help.

12:55.520 --> 12:59.940
It was a cinch getting into the country.
It's been smooth sailing so far.

13:00.020 --> 13:03.780
Let's just hope this pass
works as well with the GGP...

13:05.820 --> 13:10.080
Don't get in over your head.
The situation could change at any time.

13:10.160 --> 13:12.620
There are some things even out of my control.

13:12.700 --> 13:15.660
Alrighty. Be patient and don't get your hopes up.

13:39.060 --> 13:40.360
Where are you?

13:40.440 --> 13:45.190
A Diet member's daughter going
missing at a time like this is no joke.

13:45.280 --> 13:50.120
Sorry. I thought contacting
you might cause you trouble.

13:50.200 --> 13:51.580
What happened?

13:53.290 --> 13:58.500
Nothing at all.
Tenshiro Okakura was nowhere to be found.

14:00.210 --> 14:02.750
Tomorrow the GGP starts its
building-to-building operation

14:02.840 --> 14:05.210
to stamp out the terrorists.

14:05.300 --> 14:07.590
There really is no safe place.

14:07.680 --> 14:09.050
I know.

14:09.140 --> 14:11.090
Call Dad.

14:11.180 --> 14:14.060
Despite how it seems, he is worried about you.

14:14.850 --> 14:16.230
Thanks.

14:26.650 --> 14:28.450
Ms. Kataoka, yes?

14:37.040 --> 14:41.710
Don't let the GGP meddle in
domestic affairs! Get the hell out, GGP!

14:41.790 --> 14:47.380
With protests in full swing,
the seizure of civilian RideBacks has begun,

14:47.470 --> 14:49.970
to prevent their use by terrorists.

14:50.050 --> 14:51.220
As a result of--

14:51.300 --> 14:56.010
This is bad. Before long,
the GGP's gonna show up here too.

14:56.100 --> 14:58.140
They're going to seize our stuff?

14:58.230 --> 15:00.810
They might even lock us out of the building.

15:00.900 --> 15:05.360
You can't be serious!
If Rin comes back she'll be sad!

15:05.440 --> 15:07.570
What can we possibly do?

15:07.650 --> 15:10.860
It's pointless. We're talking
about the military and police here.

15:10.950 --> 15:13.620
Anything is possible if we put our minds to it!

15:14.200 --> 15:15.740
Right, Shoko?!

15:18.120 --> 15:20.910
To be honest...

15:21.000 --> 15:24.960
...I don't think we should get any more involved.

15:25.040 --> 15:28.010
I don't want any more people to get hurt...

15:29.800 --> 15:33.260
I'm sure Rin feels that way more than anyone.

15:36.260 --> 15:37.850
I'll fight.

15:39.310 --> 15:43.560
My life is nothing without these.

15:43.650 --> 15:47.360
It was because of them that I met all of you, even.

15:48.990 --> 15:53.240
We can't just let them label
RideBacks as terrorist tools

15:53.320 --> 15:56.160
and take them from us.

15:56.240 --> 15:59.200
You're almost passionate to a fault...

16:11.260 --> 16:13.970
You were quicker this time.

16:18.220 --> 16:22.430
So, what business do you
have with this tenacious fool?

16:24.020 --> 16:25.690
I want to make a deal.

16:47.290 --> 16:48.880
Who is this?

16:48.960 --> 16:50.130
Me.

16:51.050 --> 16:54.880
You're an ungrateful daughter
who never cares to contact me.

16:54.970 --> 16:57.720
What do you suddenly want now?

16:59.060 --> 17:02.100
Tamayo? Tamayo?

17:07.230 --> 17:08.690
Tamayo?

17:12.820 --> 17:15.400
What are you doing there?

17:15.490 --> 17:18.450
I can't say. It would only cause you trouble.

17:21.240 --> 17:22.580
L-Listen...

17:22.660 --> 17:25.710
Call me with all the trouble you want.

17:25.790 --> 17:29.880
It's a child's duty to trouble her parents.

17:29.960 --> 17:33.760
Now tell me. I'll do everything that I possibly can.

17:36.050 --> 17:38.220
I love you, Daddy...

17:50.690 --> 17:52.650
An RBZ...?

18:03.580 --> 18:05.200
A Fuego...

18:05.290 --> 18:06.830
What is one doing here?

18:31.980 --> 18:35.480
Umm... Where's the Fuego?

18:35.570 --> 18:37.820
I dismantled and destroyed it.

18:47.750 --> 18:51.370
You weren't destroyed... Thank goodness...!

19:15.820 --> 19:18.940
Goodbye, Fuego.

19:38.130 --> 19:39.380
Okay, open it.

19:46.310 --> 19:49.390
So these are my soldiers...

19:50.600 --> 19:54.520
Large-scale protests against
the GGP's anti-terrorist regulations

19:54.610 --> 19:58.650
are planned throughout the country,
beginning early tomorrow morning.

19:58.730 --> 20:01.570
5,000 members of the police force will be sent to...

20:01.650 --> 20:05.620
They'll only give the GGP
an excuse to take drastic measures...

20:20.920 --> 20:22.840
They're holding a protest march along the highway

20:22.930 --> 20:26.430
from the Great Earthquake
Memorial Square to Hinatamachi.

20:26.510 --> 20:29.350
There's going to be ten or so RideBacks there, too.

20:29.430 --> 20:32.480
Wow! That sounds serious!

20:32.560 --> 20:33.810
Hishida!

20:34.810 --> 20:36.690
A visitor.

20:36.770 --> 20:41.400
Uhh, Tamayo Kataoka asked me to deliver this...

20:44.320 --> 20:45.530
Oof...

20:53.040 --> 20:54.160
Oil?

20:54.250 --> 20:57.710
Whoa. This is impossible to get now...

20:57.790 --> 21:00.300
Oh, a letter. Let's see...

21:00.380 --> 21:05.010
"I figured our club's
cocktail base would be running low,

21:05.090 --> 21:08.180
so this is a gift from the great club
president to her adorable members.

21:08.260 --> 21:13.310
Also, our missing member is
doing fine and well, as you can see."

21:13.390 --> 21:16.560
Oh, yeah. She also left this with me.

21:18.230 --> 21:20.400
Hishida! Hurry!

21:28.240 --> 21:29.370
Rin...!

21:30.410 --> 21:32.580
That's great! She looks well!

21:36.920 --> 21:38.000
Rin...

21:39.710 --> 21:41.040
Shoko...

21:56.730 --> 22:01.400
Even when he laughs

22:03.400 --> 22:08.990
I'm thinking of you before I realize it

22:12.030 --> 22:17.040
And the hands holding his

22:18.830 --> 22:24.300
feel your warmth, too

22:26.470 --> 22:30.220
Even if I cut out my recollections

22:30.300 --> 22:34.180
and drive them out of my heart

22:34.270 --> 22:37.930
or try to kick the memories out

22:38.020 --> 22:42.400
I still think of you

22:42.480 --> 22:46.900
Time now passes and seasons fly by

22:46.990 --> 22:50.740
Even if that smile starts to become hazy

22:50.820 --> 22:54.740
my heart will never forget you

22:54.830 --> 22:58.500
(even if we can never meet again)

22:58.580 --> 23:02.330
Even if I knock over photos of us smiling

23:02.420 --> 23:06.760
or try to hide my overflowing feelings

23:07.720 --> 23:10.970
my heart will never forget

23:11.680 --> 23:14.930
my memories with you

23:26.110 --> 23:41.100
New New Hishida Theatre

23:26.820 --> 23:31.160
Long time, no see! I haven't done
this "machine gun talking" in a while!

23:31.240 --> 23:33.780
--That sounds so outdated!
--That's this show for ya!

23:33.870 --> 23:36.700
Our club is cozy and carefree
while the world's in an uproar!

23:35.950 --> 23:39.680
Next Episode:

23:36.790 --> 23:39.830
It's like the difference between
cocktail engine mode and battery mode!
